# Browser
# Words of Wind's replacement asks each player to return a permanent they control to its owner's hand (CR 614.1a): an effect,
# which pays for nothing. Bot1's page captions the question as that, not as a cost ("to pay for it", which a karoo land's or
# an alternative cost's return is), and Bot1 returns its tapped Mox Jet by clicking it.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Sol Ring
Black Lotus
Words of Wind
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Plains
Ancestral Recall
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Words of Wind.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Swamp.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Hand = Plains; Ancestral Recall
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Words of Wind.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Ancestral Recall.Cast(Bot1)
Bot1.Pass
? Client.Bot1.Prompt.Title = Words of Wind: choose a permanent to return to its owner's hand
Bot1.Choose(Mox Jet)
Bot2.Choose(Swamp)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand = Plains; Mox Jet; Island; Island
Bot1.Library.Count = 18
Bot1.Battlefield = Island; Sol Ring; Mox Sapphire; Words of Wind
Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 0
Bot2.Hand.Count = 8
